<section class="page-hero container content"><span class="pill">LEGAL</span><h1>Privacy <span class="gradient-text">Policy.</span></h1><p>Last updated: November 2026</p><h2>Information you enter into tools</h2><p>The starter calculators on this website process entered values in your browser. This starter project does not send calculator inputs to a GameToolHub server.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This starter version does not include analytics or advertising scripts. If analytics, advertising or other third-party services are added later, this policy must be updated to explain the data they collect and how visitors can manage applicable choices.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>The website is hosted by Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process technical information as part of delivering the website under its own policies.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, use the contact details on our Contact page.</p></section>
</MainLayout>
